    "Add both for each row, but when they're the same cell (odd n, middle row) add it once.",
    "total = 0\nfor i in range(n):\n    total += mat[i][i]\n    if i != n-1-i: total += mat[i][n-1-i]\nreturn total",
    "One pass over rows: O(n), not O(n^2)."
